In spring and early summer, snowmelt makes the falls fullest."],"poi":"sisters"},{"t0":130.96,"dur":0.6,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":131.56,"dur":6.5,"zh":["七姐妹附近的岩棚上，是克尼夫斯夫洛農場。"],"en":["On a ledge near the Seven Sisters: Knivsflå farm."],"poi":"knivsflaa"},{"t0":138.06,"dur":16.64,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":154.7,"dur":6.5,"zh":["附近還有一道「新娘面紗」瀑布。"],"en":["Nearby falls the Bridal Veil."],"poi":"veil"},{"t0":161.2,"dur":116.3,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":277.5,"dur":13.0,"zh":["抵達海勒蘇爾特，村中有一道瀑布穿過。","2026 年起，一萬總噸以下的客船在遺產峽灣內必須零排放。"],"en":["Arriving at Hellesylt, where a waterfall runs through the village.","Since 2026, passenger ships under 10,000 gross tons must be zero-emission in these fjords."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"啟航：蓋倫格碼頭","en":"Departure: Geiranger ferry quay"},{"t":72.35,"tt":1059,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 982 公尺：斯卡格夫洛農場","en":"Skageflå farm, 982 m left","k":"skageflaa"},{"t":103.57,"tt":1143,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 811 公尺：求婚者瀑布","en":"The Suitor (Friaren), 811 m left","k":"suitor"},{"t":123.81,"tt":1185,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 332 公尺：七姐妹瀑布","en":"Seven Sisters waterfall, 332 m right","k":"sisters"},{"t":123.81,"tt":1185,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 720 公尺：克尼夫斯夫洛農場","en":"Knivsflå farm, 720 m right","k":"knivsflaa"},{"t":157.62,"tt":1519,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 545 公尺：新娘面紗瀑布","en":"Bridal Veil (Brudesløret), 545 m right","k":"veil"},{"t":300.0,"tt":3600,"kind":"arr","zh":"抵達：海勒蘇爾特碼頭","en":"Arrival: Hellesylt ferry quay"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：路線取自 OpenStreetMap，速度與時間為示意，並非實際班次紀錄；地形與衛星影像為真實資料。","en":"Simulation: the path comes from OpenStreetMap; speeds and times are illustrative, not a real timetable. Terrain and satellite imagery are real data."},"geo_src":"OSM way 25790247 (route=ferry Geiranger - Hellesylt, Fjord1 RS60), reversed to run Geiranger→Hellesylt","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"UNESCO World Heritage Centre: West Norwegian Fjo